        "original_id": "ec8ff054-4c4b-5402-9a80-d46af0b9b684",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Supergrass, Quietdrive\n- People: Mike Smith\n- Companies: EMI Publishing, Epic Records\n- Places: Oxford, Hopkins, Minnesota\n- Products: Fall from the Ceiling EP\n- Roles: Head of A&R\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Mike Smith moved to EMI Publishing and later signed acts including Supergrass, as well as re-signing Blur and advancing to Head of A&R.\n- In 1993, Supergrass formed as an English rock band in Oxford.\n- In 2002, Quietdrive formed as an alternative rock band based in Hopkins, Minnesota.\n- On September 27, 2005, Quietdrive released the Fall from the Ceiling EP under Epic Records.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
